# Catch Everything - per-user settings of the COMPANY install / 회사 배포용 사용자별 설정
#
# Template of scripts/provision_user_config.sh (run by the installer's postinstall for the logged-in user, and by MDM for other users):
# it becomes ~/Library/Application Support/MeetingCapture/config.env, ONLY when that file does not exist yet (an existing file is never
# overwritten). A word between two @ signs is filled in per user; nothing of the personal install (name, mail address, Drive folder)
# is in this file. Format and rules are those of config/config.env.example (KEY=VALUE, '#' comments, '~' expanded, spaces allowed).
# 설치 프로그램(postinstall)과 MDM이 사용자별로 만드는 파일입니다. 이미 있는 config.env는 덮어쓰지 않습니다. @...@ 는 사용자별로 채워집니다.
#
# WHAT DECIDES WHAT / 무엇이 우선하는가
#   1. The organisation policy (/Library/Application Support/MeetingCapture/policy.json, docs/POLICY.md) can only restrict. Its "enforced" values
#      win over this file, its "defaults" apply only to keys that are NOT set here, and it ignores PROJECT_DIR and PYTHON_BIN below (the
#      runtime is the root-owned release). The company baseline enforces LOG_CONTENT=0, ASR_ALLOW_DOWNLOAD=0, MIC_MUTE_GATE=on, NOTIFY_RECORDING=1;
#      it sets the defaults LOG_RETENTION_DAYS=30 (days) and APP_LOG_MAX_MB=5 (5 files of 5 MB). That is why those keys are NOT set here: a key
#      set here would hide the organisation's default.
#   2. Everything outside the policy is yours: change a line, restart the app (Quit and reopen), the pipeline reads the file on every run.
#   조직 정책이 먼저입니다(제한만 가능, enforced가 이 파일보다 강하고 defaults는 여기에 없는 키에만 적용). 아래 PROJECT_DIR와 PYTHON_BIN은 정책이 있으면 무시됩니다.
#
# Which lanes work is decided by the policy and your IT department, not by this file: with the company baseline nothing leaves this Mac
# (docs/PRIVACY_LANES.md). Keys that name a lane (TRANSCRIPT_CLEANUP, NOTE_VERIFY, CALENDAR_LOOKUP, ARCHIVE_DIR) only take effect when the
# policy allows that lane.
# 어떤 레인이 열리는지는 정책이 정합니다. 기준 정책에서는 아무것도 이 Mac 밖으로 나가지 않습니다(docs/PRIVACY_LANES.md).

# ============================== Paths / 경로 ==============================

# Where finished meetings go: the team shared drive folder of Google Drive for desktop. Filled in by the provisioning script from the Drive
# mount of your company account; EMPTY when no such mount exists yet. Empty means: the meeting stays on this Mac (LOCAL_ARCHIVE_DIR, default
# ~/Library/Application Support/MeetingCapture/local-meetings) and the Drive lane is skipped. The folder must also match the organisation's
# archive.allowed_roots, otherwise the meeting stays local as well. To fill the line later: log in to Drive for desktop with your company
# account, then set the folder here yourself (the path of the team shared drive's Meetings folder) or ask IT to provision this line again.
# 회의 결과 폴더(팀 공유 드라이브). 회사 계정의 Drive 마운트가 없으면 비어 있고, 그러면 회의는 이 Mac의 로컬 폴더에 저장되며 Drive 업로드는 하지 않습니다.
# 나중에 채우려면 Google Drive for desktop에 회사 계정으로 로그인한 뒤 여기에 폴더를 직접 적거나 IT 헬프데스크에 문의하세요.
ARCHIVE_DIR=@ARCHIVE_DIR@

# The runtime of this Mac: the root-owned release (installed by the package, switched with "mcap release switch"). A policy-managed Mac ignores both lines.
# 이 Mac의 런타임(root 소유 릴리스). 정책이 있는 Mac은 두 줄을 무시합니다.
PROJECT_DIR=@RELEASE_ROOT@/current
PYTHON_BIN=@RELEASE_ROOT@/current/venv/bin/python

# ============================== Me / 나 ==============================

# Label of your own microphone track in transcripts (the other track is always "Remote"). Filled in with your name from the directory.
# transcript에서 내 마이크 트랙의 이름(상대방 트랙은 항상 "Remote"). 사용자 이름으로 채워집니다.
SELF_NAME=@SELF_NAME@

# ============================== Detection / 감지 (Swift app) ==============================

# Platforms detected automatically: zoom, teams (meet is off by default; the company install does not enable it).
# 자동 감지할 플랫폼. 회사 배포는 meet을 켜지 않습니다.
ENABLED_PLATFORMS=zoom,teams

# Calls of other apps (Slack huddle, Webex, FaceTime, ...) are NOT limited by the list above: CALL_DETECT is. It is not set here on purpose: on a Mac with a policy an
# unset CALL_DETECT means off, so only Zoom and Teams are recorded; the policy can set CALL_DETECT (known | generic | off) in "defaults" or lock it in "enforced".
# 다른 앱의 통화(Slack 허들, Webex, FaceTime 등)는 위 목록이 아니라 CALL_DETECT가 정합니다. 여기에는 쓰지 않으며, 정책이 있는 Mac에서 CALL_DETECT가 비어 있으면 off라서
# Zoom과 Teams만 녹음합니다. 정책의 defaults 또는 enforced로 CALL_DETECT(known | generic | off)를 정할 수 있습니다.

# ============================== Claude / 회의록 (only when the organisation opens the llm lane) ==============================

# Who pays for the Claude calls. The company baseline keeps the llm lane CLOSED, so this line only matters in a pilot group where the policy
# allows it: then api = the per-user Anthropic API key in YOUR Keychain (store it once: mcap api-key set), subscription = your Claude login.
# Filled in by the provisioning script: "api" when it was run for a group with the llm lane open (--llm allow), else "subscription", the value
# that never reads a Keychain item. The organisation can also set it through the policy (defaults/enforced).
# Claude 호출 과금 방식. 기준 정책에서는 llm 레인이 닫혀 있어 이 줄은 파일럿 그룹에서만 의미가 있습니다.
CLAUDE_AUTH=@CLAUDE_AUTH@

# ============================== Everything else / 그 밖의 설정 ==============================

# Every other key of config/config.env.example has a built-in default and may be added here when you need it, for example
#   LOCAL_ONLY_DEFAULT=1     start every new recording as a local-only meeting (a policy can raise this default, never lower it)
#   ASR_ENGINE=whisper       or remote (the company server, needs a consent and a policy that allows it), see docs/PRIVACY_LANES.md
#   AUDIO_RETENTION_DAYS=90  delete the *.m4a of meetings older than this many days (transcripts are never deleted)
# Secrets (API key, relay token) never go into this file: they live in the Keychain.
# 다른 키는 config/config.env.example에 있고 필요할 때 추가합니다. 비밀(API 키, 릴레이 토큰)은 이 파일에 쓰지 않고 Keychain에만 둡니다.
